{"description":"We are first year student pursuing engineering in Information Technology. We dont actually know our intrests or skills. We don’t want to put sheer pressure of expectations on our teammates. Just join for the love of the game and for enthusiasm which took you here.","image":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/IMG_6716_qfQOiY7.2e16d0ba.fill-300x250.jpg","summary":"Our project is an illustrated digital children's book on the topic “Abandoned but not Forgotten: Storytelling about NASA's Discarded Equipment on the Moon and Mars”. We are addressing the challenge visually and textually using illustrated digital children's book. We hope our project makes curiosity and enthusiasm in young minds.","details":"<p>Our project is an illustrated digital children&#x27;s book. Any child with mobile phone, laptop, pc, tablet etc. or via parent‘s device can easily access our digital book. Our core intention is to make curiosity and enthusiasm in children about space and Nasa. We used creative tool named &quot;Canva&quot; mainly and simplebooklet.com. We have given a whole creative vibe and tone for the digital book throughout the very end. We have illustrated each page with thought of making it loveable and curious for children by placing pictures and text with kid friendly font.</p>","dataRefs":[["image and texts","https://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/nmc/spacecraft/display.action?id=1969-059C"],["image and texts","https://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/nmc/spacecraft/display.action?id=1971-063C"],["image and texts","https://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/nmc/spacecraft/display.action?id=1969-099C"],["image and texts","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/surveyor-3/"],["image and texts","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/mars-pathfinder/"],["image and texts","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/mars-exploration-rovers-spirit-and-opportunity/"],["images and texts","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/viking-1/"],["image and text","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/insight/"],["text","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/dawn/"],["text","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/near-shoemaker/"],["image and texts","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/pioneer-10/"],["image and texts","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/mars-2020-perseverance/ingenuity-mars-helicopter/"],["texts","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/kepler/"]],"projectRefs":[["blue moon","https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTC5VUsCxwVHiOSN9lpULMQENt1f-PkFIANmbdFECx1hQ&s=10"],["blood moon","https://media.wired.com/photos/5c425dd1ce277c2cb23d5667/1:1/w_1489,h_1489,c_limit/Blood-Moon-586081787.jpg"],["pink moon","https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQ1ljZZMKMeTbpv9_JO2yIA3zJ10TT0YH9IUYEHHrmagf7ctENmVeP59kx9&s=10"],["lavander hues moon","https://i.pinimg.com/564x/12/46/d7/1246d7de16d7c4d9a8922649aa67c442.jpg"],["mars","https://www.notebookcheck.net/fileadmin/Notebooks/News/_nc5/Planet-Mars-Image-source-Digital-Vision.jpg"],["mars","https://www.sciencealert.com/images/2023/08/MarsPlanetIllustration-642x260.jpg"],["mars","https://www.marthastewart.com/thmb/oRtjEI96BwgBy5qzAuMvp-qHdkM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale("],["dawn spacecraft","https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTANdcN3TyUNR7RghEtFu-3uTgHPuYZqo1wk9EtZ-upBQ&s=10"],["near shoemaker","https://www.jhuapl.edu/sites/default/files/2024-03/IMG-Mission-NEAR.jpg"],["kepler space telescope","https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTDEKWUeNzQDRqXVHKDWFMrITQlDXqF1dEs6Aa8QMn9iQ&s=10"],["kepler space telescope","https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/ACD18-0204-002/ACD18-0204-002~large.jpg?w=1920&h=1080&fit=clip&crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint"]],"members":[{"name":"ABINANDH PRADEEP P","country":"India","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/IMG_6079_W4fiEpx.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":true},{"name":"Anugrah K","country":"India","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/1000014866_xDNweOZ.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":false},{"name":"Amegh V","country":"India","avatar":nu